@startuml
title D-06 Vendor PMS Connector Projection and Freshness Flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

cloud "Vendor PMS / HCP\nraw session + normal tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Connector Instance\nconfigured runtime connector" as Connector
component "Central PMS Projection\noperational visibility" as Projection
component "Freshness / Health Classifier\nconceptual status only" as Freshness
component "Operator Console\nhealth visibility" as Console
component "Management Dashboard\nfreshness labels" as Dashboard
component "Continuity Workflow\ncontrolled degraded support" as Continuity
component "Audit / Event Stream\nhealth + projection facts" as Audit

Vendor --> Connector : passageway / session / tariff integration
Connector --> Projection : update operational projection
Connector --> Freshness : report poll outcome and health
Projection --> Freshness : last known projection context
Freshness --> Console : stale warnings / connector health
Freshness --> Dashboard : source and freshness labels
Freshness --> Continuity : degraded eligibility evidence
Projection --> Continuity : allowed degraded support only
Freshness --> Audit : health / freshness fact
Projection --> Audit : projection update fact

note right of Vendor
Normal tariff and raw session authority
remain with Vendor PMS / HCP.
end note

note bottom of Projection
Projection is operational visibility and
controlled degraded support only.
It is not financial truth.
end note

note bottom of Freshness
Exact thresholds and status model are open.
end note
@enduml
